msgid ""
"Add vimeo video id here e.g (217936008). Do not put complete video URL only "
"enter video ID that come after this URL (https://vimeo.com/)"
msgstr "Add meg itt a Vimeo-videó ID-ját, pl. (217936008). Ne a teljes videó-URL-t add meg, csak az URL után következő videó-ID-t (https://vimeo.com/)"

#: admin/class-afpv-admin.php:280 admin/class-afpv-admin.php:511
msgid ""
"Add your YouTube video ID like (6lt2JfJdGSY). Do not put complete video URL "
"only enter video ID that come after this URL "
